                    Hi! I'm your AI Mentor. Start writing in the editor. I'll read along and offer <span class="font-semibold text-brand-600">vocabulary upgrades</span>, <span class="font-semibold text-emerald-600">grammar fixes</span>, and <span class="font-semibold text-amber-600">cohesion tips</span>.
