                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 block mb-1">Paragraph 2: Overview (2-3 sentences)</span>
                        Highlight 2 or 3 general trends/key features without referencing specific figures. This is the most crucial paragraph for achieving Band 6.0+.
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 block mb-1">Paragraphs 3 & 4: Body Details (3-4 sentences each)</span>
                        Describe and compare specific statistics. Make sure to group key features logically and include relevant units (e.g. percentages, tonnes).
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

